      "message": "Thanks for the comments. If we decide to add scan setting to scan result count, I think we also need to record scan_radio_duration per scan settings. I though we can add scan settings in WW counter metrics but we can try to add it in BT counter metrics now. Does it make sense?\n\n@regular scan radio result \n+ screen on\n--- scan mode (screen off, low power, balanced, low latency) \n+ screen off\n--- scan mode (screen off, low power, balanced, low latency) \n\n@regular scan radio duration\n+ screen on\n--- scan mode (screen off, low power, balanced, low latency) \n+ screen off\n--- scan mode (screen off, low power, balanced, low latency)",
